{"seq":3,"slug":"session-query-flow","title":"会话内 query 流转路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/query-log-analytics-insight/intent-distribution/session-query-flow","wordCount":2927,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"会话内-query-流转路径\">会话内 query 流转路径</h1><p>用户很少只搜一次。他从 <code>连衣裙</code> 开始，看一眼结果，改成 <code>连衣裙 长款</code>，再改成 <code>连衣裙 长款 显瘦</code>，最后点了某个商品。这条序列里包含了单次 query 分析永远看不到的信息：他在<strong>逐步收窄需求</strong>，一开始的宽泛词不代表他的真实意图，后面的修饰词才是。把搜索日志切成会话、把会话内的一次次 query 按时间串起来，就能把「用户想找什么」从单点猜测变成一条可读的路径。</p>\n<p>会话视角补上了意图分析缺的那块拼图。前两节讲的是 query 在语义和量级维度上的静态分布，而这里关注的是<strong>动态</strong>：用户如何通过连续多次搜索来逼近目标、在哪一步放弃、放弃之前做了什么。这个视角对产品的价值在于，它把「搜索不好用」这种模糊感受，变成了「用户搜了 4.2 次才成交，第 3 次的高频改写路径是 X→Y，而 Y 的结果质量差」这样的可修复结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"会话切分是第一个设计决策\">会话切分是第一个设计决策</h3><p>会话的定义本身就是第一个设计决策。技术上常用<strong>30 分钟不活动切分</strong>（同业界的标准做法，源自 web 分析传统），也有按自然日切分的。切分粒度直接影响结论：切太细会把一次真实的探索拆成多个会话，低估改写次数；切太粗会把两次无关的搜索混成一个会话，高估复杂度。电商场景通常取 30 分钟，并结合「页面跳转」边界做修正。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[原始搜索事件&lt;br/&gt;含 user_id/session_id/时间] --&gt; B[会话切分&lt;br/&gt;30min 不活动]&#10;    B --&gt; C[排序 query 序列]&#10;    C --&gt; D{路径分析}&#10;    D --&gt; E[改写次数分布]&#10;    D --&gt; F[query 间转化率&lt;br/&gt;马尔可夫链]&#10;    D --&gt; G[放弃点定位&lt;br/&gt;退出前最后一次搜索]&#10;    D --&gt; H[意图漂移检测&lt;br/&gt;前后语义距离]&#10;    E --&gt; I[重写/收窄/扩宽/换目标]&#10;    F --&gt; I&#10;    G --&gt; J[体验缺陷定位]&#10;    H --&gt; J&#10;    I --&gt; K[产品与召回改进]&#10;    J --&gt; K\">graph TD\n    A[原始搜索事件&lt;br/&gt;含 user_id/session_id/时间] --&gt; B[会话切分&lt;br/&gt;30min 不活动]\n    B --&gt; C[排序 query 序列]\n    C --&gt; D{路径分析}\n    D --&gt; E[改写次数分布]\n    D --&gt; F[query 间转化率&lt;br/&gt;马尔可夫链]\n    D --&gt; G[放弃点定位&lt;br/&gt;退出前最后一次搜索]\n    D --&gt; H[意图漂移检测&lt;br/&gt;前后语义距离]\n    E --&gt; I[重写/收窄/扩宽/换目标]\n    F --&gt; I\n    G --&gt; J[体验缺陷定位]\n    H --&gt; J\n    I --&gt; K[产品与召回改进]\n    J --&gt; K</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>流转类型</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>通常意味着</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>收窄（narrowing）</td>\n<td>后续 query 是前者的子集/更具体</td>\n<td><code>耳机</code> → <code>耳机 降噪</code></td>\n<td>结果太宽，用户在筛</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩宽（broadening）</td>\n<td>后续 query 更泛</td>\n<td><code>白色 40码 跑鞋</code> → <code>跑鞋</code></td>\n<td>前者无结果或结果差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>改写（reformulation）</td>\n<td>换同义不同词</td>\n<td><code>笔记本</code> → <code>laptop</code></td>\n<td>召回词表覆盖不足</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纠错（correction）</td>\n<td>修正拼写</td>\n<td><code>阿迪答斯</code> → <code>阿迪达斯</code></td>\n<td>纠错未生效或用户不信任</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>换目标（pivot）</td>\n<td>语义上换了主题</td>\n<td><code>手机壳</code> → <code>充电器</code></td>\n<td>可能是正常浏览，也可能是失败后重新开始</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回退（back）</td>\n<td>回到之前的 query</td>\n<td>A → B → A</td>\n<td>B 的结果更差，用户在比较</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"会话切分与序列构造\">会话切分与序列构造</h2><h3 id=\"sessionization-按-30-分钟超时切分\">Sessionization：按 30 分钟超时切分</h3><p>切分之后要做的是把事件按时间排序，并过滤掉噪声。噪声的主要来源是<strong>埋点重复</strong>（同一次搜索被上报多次，需要按 request_id 去重）和<strong>预输入补全触发</strong>（用户输入过程中系统自动发的搜索请求，不是用户真实意图，需要按来源字段剔除）。这两类噪声不清掉，改写次数会被系统性高估。</p>\n<p>会话切分的标准实现是「按用户分区、按时间排序、相邻事件间隔超阈值则开新会话」。用窗口函数表达，一次扫描即可完成：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH cleaned AS (&#10;  SELECT user_hash, ts, query, request_id, source&#10;  FROM search_events&#10;  WHERE source &lt;&gt; &#39;autocomplete&#39;      -- 剔除补全触发&#10;  QUALIFY ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY request_id ORDER BY ts) = 1  -- 埋点去重&#10;),&#10;flagged AS (&#10;  SELECT *,&#10;         CASE WHEN ts - LAG(ts) OVER (PARTITION BY user_hash ORDER BY ts)&#10;                   &gt; INTERVAL &#39;30&#39; MINUTE&#10;              OR LAG(ts) OVER (PARTITION BY user_hash ORDER BY ts) IS NULL&#10;              THEN 1 ELSE 0 END AS is_new_session&#10;  FROM cleaned&#10;),&#10;sessioned AS (&#10;  SELECT *,&#10;         SUM(is_new_session) OVER (PARTITION BY user_hash ORDER BY ts&#10;                                   ROWS UNBOUNDED PRECEDING) AS session_seq&#10;  FROM flagged&#10;)&#10;SELECT user_hash || &#39;-&#39; || CAST(session_seq AS VARCHAR) AS session_id,&#10;       MIN(ts) AS session_start,&#10;       COUNT(*) AS query_cnt,&#10;       ARRAY_AGG(query ORDER BY ts) AS query_sequence&#10;FROM sessioned&#10;GROUP BY user_hash, session_seq;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cleaned </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_hash, ts, query, request_id, source</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> search_events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> source </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'autocomplete'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      -- 剔除补全触发</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  QUALIFY </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ROW_NUMBER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> request_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  -- 埋点去重</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">flagged </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> LAG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ts) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_hash </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                   ></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> MINUTE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">              OR</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> LAG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ts) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_hash </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">              THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> is_new_session</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cleaned</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sessioned </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(is_new_session) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_hash </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                   ROWS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNBOUNDED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRECEDING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> session_seq</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flagged</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_hash </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '-'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> CAST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(session_seq </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> session_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       MIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ts) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> session_start,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> query_cnt,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       ARRAY_AGG(query </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> query_sequence</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sessioned</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_hash, session_seq;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>is_new_session</code> 用 <code>LAG</code> 判断与前一条事件的时间差，再用前缀和把会话序号累积出来——这是 sessionization 的标准模式（gap-and-islands）。30 分钟这个阈值必须作为参数而不是硬编码，因为移动端与桌面端、不同品类的合理阈值并不相同。</p>\n<h3 id=\"会话对象的最小结构\">会话对象的最小结构</h3><p>会话对象的最小结构是 <code>(session_id, query_sequence[], clicked_items[], duration, terminal_event)</code>，其中 <code>terminal_event</code>（会话如何结束：成交/加购/退出/超时）决定了这次会话算成功还是失败。这个字段是后续一切分析的标签——没有它，你只能看到用户做了什么，看不到结果好不好。</p>\n<p>一个容易被忽略的细节：<strong>会话不是独立的</strong>。同一个用户在一天内可能有多个会话，跨会话的意图延续（上午搜过、下午接着搜）需要 user_id 维度才能捕捉。是否要建跨会话视图，取决于分析目标——分析单次探索行为用会话级足够，分析用户旅程则需要用户级。两者的隐私处理强度不同，跨会话分析涉及用户轨迹，必须用哈希 ID 且报表层不暴露原始标识。</p>\n<h2 id=\"改写次数的分布与体验含义\">改写次数的分布与体验含义</h2><h3 id=\"分布比均值更有信息量\">分布比均值更有信息量</h3><p>最基础也最有用的指标是<strong>每次成交前的搜索次数</strong>分布。它的均值直接反映搜索效率，它的<strong>尾部形状</strong>则揭示体验缺陷。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>改写次数</th>\n<th>会话占比</th>\n<th>成交率</th>\n<th>解读</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1 次</td>\n<td>62%</td>\n<td>8.4%</td>\n<td>一击命中，搜索体验良好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 次</td>\n<td>19%</td>\n<td>5.1%</td>\n<td>轻微调整，正常</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3–4 次</td>\n<td>12%</td>\n<td>2.7%</td>\n<td>明显的探索或挣扎</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5–9 次</td>\n<td>5%</td>\n<td>0.8%</td>\n<td>高度挣扎，长尾覆盖问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10 次以上</td>\n<td>2%</td>\n<td>0.2%</td>\n<td>系统基本失败</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的价值在最后两行。10 次以上改写的会话虽然只占 2%，但它们是最强烈的体验信号——这些用户没有离开，而是坚持在站内找，说明需求明确但系统没接住。把这批会话单独捞出来，看它们的 query 序列，往往能定位到具体的召回缺口。这是<strong>失败会话挖掘</strong>的标准方法，也是 <a href=\"../query-supply-gap/unmet-demand-discover\">未满足需求发现</a> 的数据来源之一。</p>\n<p>要小心均值陷阱：平均改写次数 1.8 次听起来很正常，但它可能由「62% 的人搜一次就走 + 少数人搜二十次」构成。分布必须看，均值只是导航。</p>\n<h2 id=\"马尔可夫链与路径可视化\">马尔可夫链与路径可视化</h2><h3 id=\"状态空间必须映射到主题\">状态空间必须映射到主题</h3><p>把 query 序列建模成一阶马尔可夫链，就能计算任意两个 query（或主题）之间的转移概率，进而回答「从 A 出发的用户最常走到哪」。状态空间不能直接用原始 query（太稀疏），必须先映射到主题或规范化形式——这直接复用 <a href=\"../query-clustering/query-similarity-cluster\">Query 相似度聚类与主题发现</a> 与 <a href=\"../query-clustering/query-normalize-merge\">等价/同义 query 归一聚合</a> 的产物。</p>\n<p>转移概率的标准定义是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{ij} = \\frac{n_{ij}}{\\sum_{k} n_{ik}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3787em;vertical-align:-0.57em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8087em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op mtight\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1746em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1786em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3214em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ik</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.5073em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.57em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是会话内从主题 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 转到主题 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 的出现次数。自环 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{ii}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ii</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 就是「同一主题内反复改写」的比例。用 SQL 一次算完转移对与自环率：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH seq AS (&#10;  SELECT session_id, topic_id,&#10;         LEAD(topic_id) OVER (PARTITION BY session_id ORDER BY ts) AS next_topic&#10;  FROM session_topic_events&#10;),&#10;pairs AS (&#10;  SELECT topic_id AS from_topic,&#10;         COALESCE(next_topic, &#39;__EXIT__&#39;) AS to_topic,&#10;         COUNT(*) AS n&#10;  FROM seq&#10;  GROUP BY 1, 2&#10;)&#10;SELECT from_topic, to_topic, n,&#10;       n / SUM(n) OVER (PARTITION BY from_topic)              AS trans_prob,&#10;       -- 自环率：同主题内改写，反映结果无法让用户满意&#10;       SUM(CASE WHEN to_topic = from_topic THEN n END)&#10;         OVER (PARTITION BY from_topic)&#10;         / SUM(n) OVER (PARTITION BY from_topic)               AS self_loop_rate&#10;FROM pairs&#10;WHERE n &gt;= :min_support          -- 低频边不进入报表，避免长尾噪声&#10;ORDER BY from_topic, n DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seq </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> session_id, topic_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         LEAD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(topic_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> session_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> next_topic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> session_topic_events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pairs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> topic_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> from_topic,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(next_topic, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'__EXIT__'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> to_topic,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seq</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> from_topic, to_topic, n,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> from_topic)              </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trans_prob,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       -- 自环率：同主题内改写，反映结果无法让用户满意</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> to_topic </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> from_topic </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> from_topic)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> from_topic)               </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> self_loop_rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pairs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :min_support          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 低频边不进入报表，避免长尾噪声</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> from_topic, n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>&#39;__EXIT__&#39;</code> 是一个显式的吸收态：会话结束也是一次「转移」，把它并入 <code>to_topic</code> 才能让每行的转移概率之和为 1，否则「从 A 出发的用户去哪了」这个问题会漏掉最大的一类去向——离开。</p>\n<h3 id=\"高价值信号与样本量约束\">高价值信号与样本量约束</h3><p>转移矩阵有两类高价值信号。<strong>高转移低转化的边</strong>：大量用户从主题 A 转到主题 B，但 B 的转化率很低——说明 A 的召回把用户推到了一个结果更差的主题，是一条需要修复的体验断点。<strong>自环概率异常</strong>：同一主题内反复改写的比例高，说明该主题下的结果无法让用户满意，通常是筛选维度缺失或结果多样性不足。</p>\n<p>路径分析还要处理一个统计学问题：<strong>样本量</strong>。真正的长路径组合呈指数稀疏，绝大多数具体路径只出现几次。稳妥做法是只看路径的<strong>两跳或三跳前缀</strong>，或者把路径抽象成「流转类型序列」（如 收窄→收窄→换目标），后者的状态空间小得多，统计上稳健，且对产品足够可读。</p>\n<h2 id=\"意图漂移与放弃点定位\">意图漂移与放弃点定位</h2><h3 id=\"区分正常探索与失败重启\">区分正常探索与失败重启</h3><p><strong>意图漂移</strong>指一个会话内的 query 在语义上发生了明显跳跃。它有两种截然相反的含义，必须区分：一种是正常的探索（用户先买手机再看手机壳，是合理的连带购买），另一种是失败后重新开始（搜 <code>礼物</code> 没找到合适的，转去搜别的）。区分的依据是<strong>前一段路径是否成功</strong>——如果前一段以退出或长停留无点击结束，后面的跳跃更可能是失败重启。</p>\n<p><strong>放弃点定位</strong>是会话分析最有产品价值的产出。定义「放弃」为会话的最后一次搜索之后既无点击也无成交，然后统计所有放弃会话的<strong>最后一次 query 主题</strong>分布。排名靠前的主题，就是当前搜索体验最薄弱的环节。这个方法比看整体零结果率更精准，因为它锁定了「用户努力过但最终失败」的位置，排除了那些本来就随便看看的流量。</p>\n<p>放弃点分析要与 <a href=\"long-tail-head-analysis\">头部 vs 长尾 query 分析</a> 交叉：放弃点如果集中在长尾段，说明是覆盖问题；如果集中在躯干段，说明是排序或筛选问题。两种病要用不同的药。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程实现与隐私边界\">工程实现与隐私边界</h2><h3 id=\"key-倾斜与爬虫剔除\">Key 倾斜与爬虫剔除</h3><p>会话分析的计算模式是典型的<strong>图/序列作业</strong>：按 session_id 分组、组内排序、生成序列特征（改写次数、转移对、终止类型）、再聚合。它在 Spark/Flink 上做 groupByKey + 排序即可，难点不在算法而在规模与倾斜——少数超长会话（异常用户或爬虫）会造成 key 倾斜，需要先做长度截断或分流。</p>\n<p>必须显式处理<strong>爬虫与异常会话</strong>。爬虫的特征是：query 序列极长、无点击、时间间隔规律、user_id 高度集中。不剔除它们会把改写次数均值拉高、把路径统计污染。剔除规则要写在管道里并记录剔除量，而不是靠分析师在报表上手动过滤。</p>\n<p>隐私方面，会话分析是本 hub 中<strong>最贴近个人数据</strong>的环节，因为它天然涉及用户行为轨迹。三条硬约束：report 层不得输出可反查到个人的 user_id，一律用哈希或直接丢弃；跨会话/跨设备的用户级分析需要明确的数据处理依据与用户告知；跨境场景下会话数据必须遵守数据驻留要求，不能为了分析方便把所有区域的会话汇总到一处（数据驻留与合规边界见 58 系列的相关平台）。会话级数据的保留期也应当显式定义并到期删除，而不是无限堆积。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>会话视角补上静态分布缺失的动态维度，把「搜索不好用」转化为可定位、可修复的具体断点。</li>\n<li>会话切分（30 分钟不活动）是第一个设计决策，粒度直接决定改写次数等指标的量级。</li>\n<li>必须清掉埋点重复与自动补全触发两类噪声，否则改写次数被系统性高估。</li>\n<li>改写次数分布比均值更有信息量，尾部的高挣扎会话是最强的体验信号，也是失败会话挖掘的入口。</li>\n<li>转移矩阵中「高转移低转化」的边是明确的体验断点；路径统计要做前缀截断或抽象成流转类型以保稳健。</li>\n<li>意图漂移要区分正常探索与失败重启；放弃点分析锁定了「努力过但失败」的位置，比整体零结果率更精准。</li>\n<li>会话分析计算上的难点是 key 倾斜，业务上的前提是剔除爬虫。</li>\n<li>会话数据最贴近个人，报表层不得输出可反查的 ID，跨会话分析需声明依据，跨境须守数据驻留。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>会话内反复试探的最终归宿是「这个问题到底有没有货可以满足」，见 <a href=\"../query-supply-gap/query-demand-supply-match\">query 需求与商品供给匹配度</a>；失败会话的主题分布直接输入 <a href=\"../query-supply-gap/unmet-demand-discover\">未满足需求发现</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"会话内 query 流转路径","id":"会话内-query-流转路径"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"会话切分是第一个设计决策","id":"会话切分是第一个设计决策"},{"level":2,"text":"会话切分与序列构造","id":"会话切分与序列构造"},{"level":3,"text":"Sessionization：按 30 分钟超时切分","id":"sessionization-按-30-分钟超时切分"},{"level":3,"text":"会话对象的最小结构","id":"会话对象的最小结构"},{"level":2,"text":"改写次数的分布与体验含义","id":"改写次数的分布与体验含义"},{"level":3,"text":"分布比均值更有信息量","id":"分布比均值更有信息量"},{"level":2,"text":"马尔可夫链与路径可视化","id":"马尔可夫链与路径可视化"},{"level":3,"text":"状态空间必须映射到主题","id":"状态空间必须映射到主题"},{"level":3,"text":"高价值信号与样本量约束","id":"高价值信号与样本量约束"},{"level":2,"text":"意图漂移与放弃点定位","id":"意图漂移与放弃点定位"},{"level":3,"text":"区分正常探索与失败重启","id":"区分正常探索与失败重启"},{"level":2,"text":"工程实现与隐私边界","id":"工程实现与隐私边界"},{"level":3,"text":"Key 倾斜与爬虫剔除","id":"key-倾斜与爬虫剔除"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"头部 vs 长尾 query 分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/query-log-analytics-insight/intent-distribution/long-tail-head-analysis"},"next":{"title":"Query 需求与商品供给匹配度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/query-log-analytics-insight/query-supply-gap/query-demand-supply-match"}}